abstract: >-
  Interactive R Shiny dashboard for exploring how Dutch members of parliament
  used the Gouden Eeuw (Golden Age) as a mnemonic trope between 1945 and 2024.
  It presents 447 coded speeches and supports exploration by period, party,
  speaker, temporal grammar, and symbolic work.
version: 1.0.0
